. Set sprint only if the request names a sprint number. Otherwise null.\n3. Set audience only if the request names one. Otherwise null. Do not guess.\n4. If the request fits none of the labels, use \"unclear\".\n5. Output the JSON object and nothing else.";
ctx.llm_t0 = Date.now(); ctx.llm_agent = 'orchestrator';
return [{ json: { ctx: ctx, request_body: buildReq(ctx, system, ctx.request || '(empty request)'), llm_url: ctx.cfg.llm_url } }];

